graph LR
    Supervisor[⊕ portal_supervisor.py<br/>Workout recovery and retry]
    Config[tools/portal_servers.json<br/>configured Workout command<br/>working directory and port]
    OwnerRecord[(Persistent Workout ownership record<br/>PID · exact process start time<br/>executable path · configured command<br/>working directory · port)]
    LiveInspection[Windows process inspection<br/>live PID · exact start time<br/>executable path · command line]
    IdentityMatch{Recorded owner and configured<br/>process identity match?}
    VerifiedOwner[Verified owned Workout process]
    Terminate[Terminate verified owner only]
    VerifyStopped{Listener absent after stop?}
    Restart[Restart configured Workout command]
    FailClosed[Actionable ownership diagnostic<br/>unknown / stale / mismatched owner<br/>listener left untouched]

    OwnerRecord -->|read before reclaim| Supervisor
    Config -->|expected service identity| IdentityMatch
    Supervisor -->|inspect recorded PID| LiveInspection
    OwnerRecord --> IdentityMatch
    LiveInspection --> IdentityMatch
    IdentityMatch -->|exact match| VerifiedOwner
    VerifiedOwner --> Terminate
    Terminate --> VerifyStopped
    VerifyStopped -->|yes| Restart
    VerifyStopped -->|no or verification failed| FailClosed
    IdentityMatch -->|missing / stale / mismatched| FailClosed

